<title>MEXICO: Cydsa six-month net falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Cydsa six-month net falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		  6-mos 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		 25.79 million		449.62 million</p>
<p>	Revs		3.34 bln		 3.45 bln</p>
<p>	Oper Income     415.46 million	     406.36 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost  101.79 million	gain 140.57 million</p>
<p>	 NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	     The company's full name is Cydsa SA.</p>
